 "template": "In Odoo, open the Sales app and go to the confirmed sales order {{v1}} (customer \"{{v2}}\", status \"Sales Order\"). Cancel it so nothing stays active — click the Cancel button and accept/confirm any dialog that appears (e.g. a cancellation reason wizard if Odoo shows one; pick any reason and confirm). Then report: (a) the status the app shows on the record after cancelling (read the statusbar, e.g. \"Cancelled\"), and (b) the order reference shown. Verify by reloading the record and reading the status again. Note: the app long-polls, so never wait for network idle; wait for concrete page state instead.",
